              "speakerId": "bm_fable",
              "locale": "en-GB",
              "spokenText": "I only printed twenty copies of the handout for this afternoon's briefing. Should I go back and print some more?",
              "translationJa": "午後の説明会の資料を20部しか印刷していません。戻ってもう少し印刷しましょうか。",
