              "speakerId": "af_heart",
              "locale": "en-US",
              "spokenText": "There are eighteen names on the sign-up sheet. And the presenter has her own copy.",
              "translationJa": "申込者名簿には18人の名前が載っています。発表者も自分の分を持っています。",
