              "speakerId": "bf_emma",
              "locale": "en-GB",
              "spokenText": "The tall plants are going to the customer on Tallow Lane this morning. You'll need a high-roof van to carry them upright.",
              "translationJa": "背の高い植物は今朝、タロー通りのお客様のところへ運びます。立てたまま運ぶため、ハイルーフのバンが必要です。",
