              "id": "t1",
              "type": "passage",
              "speakerId": "bm_fable",
              "locale": "en-GB",
              "spokenText": "Are you ready for this afternoon's inspection? The team going to the annex has been moved to the west wing. The annex is closed during the roof work.",
              "translationJa": "午後の点検の準備はできていますか。別館に行く班は西棟に変更されました。別館は屋根の工事中、閉鎖しています。",
              "pauseAfterMs": 460
