              "id": "t1",
              "type": "passage",
              "speakerId": "bf_emma",
              "locale": "en-GB",
              "spokenText": "I'm looking for a parcel sent by the Alder Lane branch. It's for the new reception desk, but the delivery message doesn't give a room number.",
              "translationJa": "アルダー通り支店が送った荷物を探しています。新しい受付用ですが、配達通知に部屋番号がありません。",
