              "speakerId": "bf_emma",
              "locale": "en-GB",
              "spokenText": "The client moved our meeting to eleven. I want to catch the latest train that gets us to Larkmead by ten forty-five, because the walk takes fifteen minutes.",
              "translationJa": "顧客が面会を11時に移しました。歩くのに15分かかるので、10時45分までにラークミードへ着く一番遅い列車に乗りたいです。",
