              "id": "t1",
              "type": "passage",
              "speakerId": "af_heart",
              "locale": "en-US",
              "spokenText": "We need to take six display screens to the Harven Island fair on Sunday. Can you book the ferry for us?",
              "translationJa": "日曜にハーヴェン島の展示会へディスプレイを6台運ぶ必要があります。フェリーを予約していただけますか。",
