              "id": "t3",
              "type": "passage",
              "speakerId": "bm_fable",
              "locale": "en-GB",
              "spokenText": "Let's have a dry run this afternoon. I'll bring the projector remote to the auditorium.",
              "translationJa": "今日午後にリハーサルをしましょう。講堂へプロジェクターのリモコンを持っていきます。",
              "pauseAfterMs": 420
