              "spokenText": "The coach to Orlen Point has been delayed. If your ticket is marked Orlen Point, stay put. A replacement vehicle will pick you up at the usual express stop for that destination. Please keep your ticket with you. As soon as the driver opens the door, show it before you stow your luggage.",
