              "spokenText": "Exhibitors, the hall closes at six. We're on the home stretch, with only the packing materials left to clear. If you have clean cardboard, use a container that accepts cardboard and can be wheeled back to the west dock. First flatten the boxes before putting them in. Keep sample products separate for your own courier.",
