              "spokenText": "We are recording a new episode of Voices of Grellin next Tuesday. It focuses on the town's tram history. Keep that date free if you want to join the audience. Only evening seats remain, and the step-free entrance is required for anyone using a wheelchair. Once you choose an available entrance, request a seat online before Friday.",
