              "spokenText": "Here is a message for technicians at the Rillden plant. Revised press manuals have arrived. There is no need to make a special trip. You can collect them on your next shift. The only copies approved for the press are the large-print ones marked with a green cover. Show your staff badge when you go to the storage desk.",
