              "spokenText": "Good afternoon, Glenbar craft market shoppers. The west arch is closed for cleaning. Follow the signs for a north entrance that has a ramp. Using the correct entrance will save you a long walk around the fence. Once inside, you can collect your purchases from the desk next to the café.",
