              "spokenText": "This is an update for the afternoon staff at Trevanor Dispatch. The collection van has been delayed, so move the outgoing boxes away from the loading platform. The boxes need to be kept indoors and under lock and key until the driver arrives. Please attach the manifest to the top box before moving anything.",
