              "id": "t1",
              "text": "Fieldmarsh Tool Service — estimated turnaround\nBlade Sharpening: same business day.\nCord Check: one business day after drop-off.\nBasic Tune: two business days after drop-off.\nFull Rebuild: five business days after drop-off.\nOur workshop is open from Monday through Friday.",
              "translationJa": "フィールドマーシュ工具サービス — 仕上がり目安\n刃研ぎ：持込当日。\n電源コード点検：持込の1営業日後。\n基本調整：持込の2営業日後。\n全体の分解修理：持込の5営業日後。\n工房は月曜から金曜まで営業します。",
              "type": "document"
