              "text": "The Ostel Reach design bus will make its first stop at the Pebbleton Library on Saturday. [1]\nChildren's sessions run in the morning, and the evening sessions are open to visitors aged sixteen and older. [2]\nYou need to book the evening sessions in advance. Multiple people may use one booking as long as all their names are listed. [3]\nBring the blue confirmation card from the booking desk when you arrive. [4]",
